        <definition>void ProgramThrashTests::Initialize</definition>
        <argsstring>() override</argsstring>
        <name>Initialize</name>
        <qualifiedname>ProgramThrashTests::Initialize</qualifiedname>
        <reimplements refid="d2/d3e/classTestSuite_1a1c4756eb905d6d4d35e1630107396c38">Initialize</reimplements>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Initializes the test suite and creates test cases.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="remark"><para>Reupload Renders hundreds of tiny triangles using individual DRAW_ARRAYS calls, uploading a short passthrough vertex program before each draw.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>ReuploadLong Renders hundreds of tiny triangles using individual DRAW_ARRAYS calls, uploading a passthrough vertex program that fills all 136 instruction slots before each draw.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="remark"><para>Resident Renders hundreds of tiny triangles using individual DRAW_ARRAYS calls, alternating between two vertex programs that are both resident in transform program memory by changing the program start address before each draw. All draws overlap, so the visible triangle is solid green if the number of draws is even and vertex colored if it is odd. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
